      61.44,
      270.72,
      69.6
     ],
     "text": "been paid. Inactive applications will be examined and, should"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      36.0,
      72.0,
      270.72,
      80.64
     ],
     "text": "they not fully comply with Section 26 of the PVR Act 1987,"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      35.52,
      83.04,
      270.72,
      91.68
     ],
     "text": "they will be refused. As a result provisional protection will"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      36.0,
      94.08,
      270.72,
      102.24
     ],
     "text": "lapse, priority claims on that variety will be lost and should the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      36.0,
      104.64,
      269.76,
      113.28
     ],
     "text": "variety have been sold, it will be ineligible for plant variety"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      35.52,
      115.68,
      271.2,
      124.32
     ],
     "text": "rights on reapplication. Continued use of labels or any other"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      35.52,
      126.24,
      270.24,
      134.88
     ],
     "text": "means to falsely imply that a variety is protected after the appli-"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      35.52,
      137.28,
      270.72,
      145.92
     ],
     "text": "cation has been refused is an offence under Section 52 (2) (b)"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      35.52,
      148.32,
      73.44,
      156.48
     ],
     "text": "of the Act."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "been paid. Inactive applications will be examined and, should\nthey not fully comply with Section 26 of the PVR Act 1987,\nthey will be refused. As a result provisional protection will\nlapse, priority claims on that variety will be lost and should the\nvariety have been sold, it will be ineligible for plant variety\nrights on reapplication. Continued use of labels or any other\nmeans to falsely imply that a variety is protected after the appli-\ncation has been refused is an offence under Section 52 (2) (b)\nof the Act.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
